{"info":{"author":"Model Context Protocol a Series of LF Projects, LLC.","author_email":null,"bugtrack_url":null,"classifiers":["Development Status :: 5 - Production/Stable","Intended Audience :: Developers","License :: OSI Approved :: MIT License","Programming Language :: Python :: 3","Programming Language :: Python :: 3.10","Programming Language :: Python :: 3.11","Programming Language :: Python :: 3.12","Programming Language :: Python :: 3.13","Programming Language :: Python :: 3.14"],"description":"# MCP Types\n\nThe wire types for the [Model Context Protocol](https://modelcontextprotocol.io).\n\nThis package holds the protocol message models, JSON-RPC envelope types, per-version\nsurface validators, and the protocol-version registry. Its only runtime dependencies are\n`pydantic` and `typing-extensions`, so it can be installed on its own when you need to\n(de)serialize MCP traffic without pulling in the full `mcp` SDK.\n\n```python\nfrom mcp_types import Tool, CallToolRequest\nfrom mcp_types.version import LATEST_PROTOCOL_VERSION\n```\n\nThe `mcp` package re-exports these names, so existing `from mcp import Tool` imports\nkeep working.\n","description_content_type":"text/markdown","docs_url":null,"download_url":null,"downloads":{"last_day":-1,"last_month":-1,"last_week":-1},"dynamic":null,"home_page":null,"keywords":"automation, llm, mcp","license":"MIT","license_expression":null,"license_files":["LICENSE"],"maintainer":null,"maintainer_email":"David Soria Parra <davidsp@anthropic.com>, Marcelo Trylesinski <marcelotryle@gmail.com>, Max Isbey <maxisbey@anthropic.com>, Felix Weinberger <fweinberger@anthropic.com>","name":"mcp-types","package_url":"https://pypi.org/project/mcp-types/","platform":null,"project_url":"https://pypi.org/project/mcp-types/","project_urls":{"Documentation":"https://py.sdk.modelcontextprotocol.io/","Homepage":"https://modelcontextprotocol.io","Issues":"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/issues","Repository":"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk"},"provides_extra":null,"release_url":"https://pypi.org/project/mcp-types/2.2.0/","requires_dist":["pydantic>=2.12.0","typing-extensions>=4.13.0"],"requires_python":">=3.10","summary":"Model Context Protocol wire types","version":"2.2.0","yanked":false,"yanked_reason":null},"last_serial":41751580,"ownership":{"organization":null,"roles":[{"role":"Owner","user":"Kludex"},{"role":"Owner","user":"dsp"},{"role":"Owner","user":"maxisbey"}]},"urls":[{"comment_text":null,"core-metadata":{"sha256":"f29cd43b57497e73976271607090609e7cf79d50c3ea3362196ac36275cdd0f0"},"digests":{"blake2b_256":"8fd76ffba5d8cd5dd9b8a19478875c50e04945314ba5074e84d749283f27f62d","md5":"b9f24b1803eb9b73495202e0e4c7424a","sha256":"ea476b73ee86709ab5abc9452385ed36cc05907e582355622e294595c9a04f13"},"downloads":-1,"filename":"mcp_types-2.2.0-py3-none-any.whl","has_sig":false,"md5_digest":"b9f24b1803eb9b73495202e0e4c7424a","packagetype":"bdist_wheel","python_version":"py3","requires_python":">=3.10","size":69106,"upload_time":"2026-09-07T16:06:21","upload_time_iso_8601":"2026-09-07T16:06:21.461724Z","url":"https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/8f/d7/6ffba5d8cd5dd9b8a19478875c50e04945314ba5074e84d749283f27f62d/mcp_types-2.2.0-py3-none-any.whl","yanked":false,"yanked_reason":null},{"comment_text":null,"core-metadata":false,"digests":{"blake2b_256":"ae91762d7755d971aff8a28d75f7961656148edf27875c8026e6385aaab08ae7","md5":"26956112060ba1f4a8d4fdf1099fe932","sha256":"d3ed53703ddd10d9c6399f29d322bb66f3f67ab41348ac8556ba23e07fedefad"},"downloads":-1,"filename":"mcp_types-2.2.0.tar.gz","has_sig":false,"md5_digest":"26956112060ba1f4a8d4fdf1099fe932","packagetype":"sdist","python_version":"source","requires_python":">=3.10","size":65892,"upload_time":"2026-09-07T16:06:25","upload_time_iso_8601":"2026-09-07T16:06:25.187150Z","url":"https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/ae/91/762d7755d971aff8a28d75f7961656148edf27875c8026e6385aaab08ae7/mcp_types-2.2.0.tar.gz","yanked":false,"ya